'' RUN: std/fs phase P4 -- BufferedReader and BufferedWriter at capacity 4; TextReader through a
'' stream that delivers one byte per read, line for line against ReadAllLines and whole against
'' ReadAllText over a corpus of BOMs, CR/LF mixes, invalid UTF-8 and odd UTF-16; TEXT_STRICT;
'' TextWriter (native NewLine, BOM once, lone surrogate); ReadLines, a missing file as one
'' failure, and the file closed when the loop is left early (a deny-sharing open succeeds
'' afterwards); the size-limited ReadAllText/ReadAllBytes and AppendAllBytes.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/fs-p4.tiko -o tests/codegen/fsp4.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/fsp4.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fsp4.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
